{"id":"ressort","lemma":"ressort","pos":"noun","rank":3512,"glosses":["spring (coiled device)","spirit, energy","motive, motivation"],"ipa":"/ʁə.sɔʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3c/Fr-ressort.ogg/Fr-ressort.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ressorts"},"formAudio":{"ressorts":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-ressorts.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Voyons ce qui en ressort.","en":"Let's see what the outcome is.","words":[{"g":"really!"},null,null,{"g":"in / of it"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"what (that which"]]},{"text":"Nous verrons ce qu'il en ressort.","en":"We'll see what comes of it.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"On n'en ressort que ce qu'on y met.","en":"You get out only what you put in.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"}]},{"text":"Le bleu de ses yeux ressort sur sa peau plutôt foncée.","en":"The blue of her eyes stands out against her rather dark skin.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"the color blue"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"eye","l":"œil"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"skin of a person or…"},{"g":"rather, instead"},{"g":"dark","l":"foncé"}]},{"text":"On n'en ressort que ce qu'on y a mis.","en":"You get out only what you put in.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"}]}]}